<title>BURUNDI: Burundi Franc weaker on dlr, firm on pound.</title>
<headline>Burundi Franc weaker on dlr, firm on pound.</headline>
<dateline>BUJUMBURA 1997-07-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Burundian franc weakened marginally against the dollar but was firm against on the pound, the Central Bank of Burundi said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Bank officials said the franc exchanged at a mean rate rate of 348.4252 against the dollar, marginally down from 348.2117 on Tuesday while against the pound, it exchanged at a mean rate of 583.4380 compared to 587.6072.</p>
</text>
